  "commonAnd": "aur",
  "narrUpdates": "Quarterly results se return on capital, debt, cash flow aur growth update hote hain; daily closing prices se valuation aur 12 mahine ka return rank.",
  "mWhatTitle": "Score kya hai",
  "mWhatBody": "Sirf published numbers se bana 0-100 score: return on capital, debt, cash flow, growth, valuation aur 12 mahine ka price return. Har stock par same rules lagte hain, aur koi insaan score chunta ya badalta nahi. Yeh company ki financial profile batata hai; yeh forecast nahi aur buy ya sell ki call nahi hai.",
  "mBands": "Score bands",
  "mBandExcellent": "Excellent: zyadatar paimano par mazboot",
  "mBandStrong": "Strong",
  "mBandAverage": "Average",
  "mBandWeak": "Weak: quality hurdle se neeche, ya risk flag",
  "mPillars": "Teen pillars",
  "mPillarsBody": "Overall score ek weighted mix hai. Valuation ya momentum ka data na ho to use chhod diya jaata hai aur uska weight baaki pillars mein baant jaata hai; andaze ki value kabhi nahi bhari jaati.",
  "mQualityBody": "Return on capital (ROCE) 40, debt to equity 25, operating cash flow vs profit 15, 5 saal ki sales aur profit growth 20 (20% saalana sales aur 25% profit par poore marks; ghatne par 0). ROCE aur debt aadha fixed scale par aur aadha same industry (15 ya zyada companies) ke rank par, warna same sector mein.",
  "mValuationBody": "Same industry ki companies se P/E ki tulna 50, apne 5 saal ke average se P/E ki tulna 30 (0.6x ya kam par poore marks, 0.85x par aadhe, 1.3x ya zyada par 0), aur 5 saal ki profit growth ke mukable P/E (PEG) 20 (1 ya kam par poore marks, 3 ya zyada par 0; growth 5% se 40% saalana ke beech gini jaati hai). Jis hisse ka data nahi, wo chhod diya jaata hai. Loss-making company ko 0 milta hai. Jin companies ne bada business demerge kiya ya jinka 5 saal ka average nahi, unme apne average ki jagah 10-year government bond ke mukable earnings yield lagta hai. Banks aur NBFCs mein P/B: banks ya NBFCs ke beech rank 60, apne 5 saal ke average se 40.",
  "mMomentumBody": "Pichhle 12 mahine ka price return, aakhri mahina chhod kar, har scored stock ke mukable rank (ek saal se kam listed stocks mein 6 mahine). RSI, MACD aur moving averages sirf jaankari ke liye hain, inka score nahi hota.",
  "mHurdleBody": "Quality pillar 55 se neeche ho to overall score 54 par ruk jaata hai. Quality 55 se 65 ke beech rok dheere dheere badhti hai (har quality point par lagbhag 4.6 points) aur 65 par khatam ho jaati hai, isliye quality ke chhote badlav se score nahi uchhalta. Sasta stock ya tez price run kamzor business ko strong bands mein nahi la sakta.",
  "mMinData": "Kam se kam data",
  "mMinDataBody": "Quality ke liye 4 mein se kam se kam 3 inputs chahiye (return on capital, debt, cash flow, growth). 2 inputs par overall score 60 par ruk jaata hai; usse kam par, ya return on capital ke bina, score nahi dikhta aur stock par DATA PENDING likha aata hai. Kami wale inputs kabhi maan kar nahi bhare jaate.",
  "mRiskFlags": "Risk flags",
  "mRiskBody": "Inme se koi bhi ho to score 28 par ruk jaata hai aur HIGH RISK FLAG dikhta hai, baaki numbers kuch bhi hon:",
  "mPledge": "Pledge",
  "mPledgeBody": "Promoter ke 75% ya zyada shares pledge, ya pledged shares company ke 25% ya zyada",
  "mNetWorth": "Net worth",
  "mNetWorthBody": "Shareholder equity zero ya negative (fundamentals dataset mein price-to-book positive ho to review mein rakha jaata hai)",
  "mDebt": "Debt",
  "mDebtBody": "Negative debt-to-equity figure (data ki gadbad)",
  "mReviewed": "Jaanche gaye pledges",
  "mReviewedBody": "Kuch bade pledges exchange filings se jaanche jaate hain. Agar promoter private-equity owner hai aur usne apne holding-company loan ke liye stake pledge kiya hai, to pledge sirf note ki tarah dikhta hai aur flag nahi lagta. Baaki har pledge par upar wala rule lagta hai.",
  "mSpecial": "Khaas cases",
  "mBanks": "Banks aur NBFCs",
  "mBanksBody": "Quality mein return on equity 30, return on assets 25, net interest margin 15 (sirf banks), leverage 10 aur growth 20. Loan quality (NPA) abhi nahi jaanchi jaati, isliye score 75 par rukta hai aur \"provisional\" badge dikhta hai.",
  "mBrokers": "Brokers",
  "mBrokersBody": "Debt ka score nahi hota (margin funding borrowings); \"provisional\" badge ke saath 75 par rukta hai.",
  "mInsurance": "Insurance, holding companies, REITs / InvITs",
  "mInsuranceBody": "Score nahi. Inke accounts in ratios mein fit nahi hote; inke liye embedded value, NAV ya yield chahiye.",
  "mEtfsBody": "Valuation neutral 60 rakha jaata hai.",
  "mReview": "Data review mein",
  "mReviewBody": "Hamare saved fundamentals exchange data ke check mein fail hon (market cap ya price kisi aur company ka) to score nahi. Data theek hote hi score wapas aata hai.",
  "mLabels": "Labels",
  "mPositiveTrend": "Positive trend",
